description:
Happy Town will produce a number of reports some monthly, others weekly and yet others daily . Reports identified below are those which have been identified as including, or potentially including, personal information. Only monthly and daily reports appear to include personal information - the details of which are set out below. Once compiled, the reports will be made accessible to Client Secure Portal  through a secure web portal.
1.1      Happy Town Monthly Reports
Happy Town Detailed Monthly User Report (227)
·         Inclusions:
o   User id;
o   department;
o   group within department;
o   Happy Town Gate id;
o   total bytes/packets in/out;
o   successful/failed connection attempts;
o   number of VPN Tunnels;
o   average/peak duration of VPN Tunnels;
o   average/peak bytes/packets per VPN Tunnel;
o   connect/disconnect timestamps;
o   number of lockouts; and
o   account status.
Happy Town Detailed Monthly User with Source IP Report (report 228)
·         Inclusions:
o   User id;
o   department;
o   group within department;
o   Happy Town Gate id;
o   For each access:
§  source IP address;
§  device identification;
§  authentication mechanism;
§  date and time; and
§  duration.
1.2        Happy Town Daily Reports
Happy Town Failed Login Report (report 235)
·         Inclusions:
o   User id;
o   Certificate number;
o   login attempt timestamp; and
o   reason for login failure.
